{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/313","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/313/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/313/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/313/events","html_url":"https://github.com/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/313","id":6025106008,"node_id":"I_kwDOVFVR088AAAABZx_SWA","number":313,"title":"[消息队列 MQ05] 消费幂等：已经处理过，为什么还会再来一遍？","user":{"login":"linhongcun","id":230383104,"node_id":"U_kgDODbteAA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230383104?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun","html_url":"https://github.com/linhongcun","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-25T13:44:10Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T02:40:47Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!-- message-queue-series:2026-10-25:mq05 -->\n\n**核心顺序5/9；MQ05仅作稳定题库索引。待定稿，未开拍。** 拟为独立视频及配套图文，无观看硬前置。\n\n## 独立问题与主线\n\n消费者已把积分写进数据库，为什么重启后还会收到同一消息？怎样让重投不再多加一次积分？\n\n1. 本片自行说明Broker投递、消费者本地事务和Consumer ACK三个对象；把“业务提交”与“Broker收到ACK”画成两个不同边界。\n2. 在提交后、ACK前退出消费者，让同一eventId重新投递；先演示无去重时积分再次增加，定位重复从何而来。\n3. 以“稳定的逻辑消费业务身份＋eventId”为唯一去重键（同一服务各实例共享，不用进程ID）；取得去重资格者在同一本地事务内记录事件并修改业务，提交后再ACK，重投者不重复修改。\n\n观众带走的结论：可靠重投允许重复投递；幂等通过原子提交约束业务效果，不靠让消息绝不再来。本片不要求先看EP.12，必要的唯一约束和本地事务含义会就地解释。\n\n## 专项对照验收\n\n用同一输入分别运行无去重和有去重两支；在提交后ACK前注入退出，再加入同eventId的并发处理，核对只产生一次业务增量、去重记录与业务修改共同提交。不能只测串行“先查后写”，也不能在回滚后遗留已处理标记。\n\n## 边界与资料\n\n固定RabbitMQ手动ACK和一个本地数据库事务。唯一约束冲突要按所选数据库正确处理；分开的查重、标记和业务写入不具备同样保证。去重键作用域、保存期与历史重放需求需明确；本地事务不覆盖支付、邮件等外部副作用，也不能拿全局最大序号一律丢弃迟到事件。\n\n- [RabbitMQ Acknowledgements and Confirms](https://www.rabbitmq.com/docs/confirms)：手动ACK与重投。\n- [PostgreSQL 18 Constraints](https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/ddl-constraints.html)：唯一约束。\n- [Idempotent Consumer（Chris Richardson）](https://microservices.io/post/microservices/patterns/2020/10/16/idempotent-consumer.html)：同事务登记去重键并提交业务修改。\n\n公共制作与验收规范统一见[总览#308](https://github.com/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/308)；数据库版本与实际去重语句在开工时固定。\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/313/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/313/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://